<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial" style="" size="2">{!Contact.FirstName},</font><div style=""><font face="arial" size="2"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial" size="2">I'm glad that we could connected today! As promised, I wanted to provide you more information on our company that will help you make an informed decision as to whether we are the right company for you.</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial" size="2"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial" size="2">I have attached a document titled "Memphis Invest Critical Numbers", which gives a summary of our company data and metrics that we use to judge our own internal performance.</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial" size="2"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial" size="2">A second attachment called "Memphis Invest Property Data" gives realistic data on each market that speaks to average prices and rents.</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial" size="2">This also shows you the types of properties that you will be adding to your portfolio.</font></div><div style=""><font size="2"><br></font></div><div style=""><font size="2">I am including a few recent property samples so that you can see how we calculate ROI on our properties.</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial" size="2"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial" size="2">Lastly, you will find a few before and after scopes of work on recently completed properties, so that you can get a feel for what the finished product looks like after our rehab process is complete.</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial" size="2"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial" size="2">After you have had a chance to review this information please <a href="https://my.timetrade.com/book/CMYYR ">CLICK HERE&nbsp;</a>to set your next call with me so that we can continue to move you along in the process.</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial" size="2"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial" size="2">To your success,</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial" size="2"><br></font></div><div style=""><div style=""><font size="2">Ashley&nbsp;<br class="Apple-interchange-newline"></font><br></div><span style="font-size: 12pt;">--&nbsp;</span></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br><div class="gmail_signature" data-smartmail="gmail_signature"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.2; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><img src="https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/pahJMtvSqUZPMoWC9CXIpb6guwnLPko5IbM5dIYLA3QT8XABGfhY9di4t_4LhDyGGy9_UMNzfLLDpiNchLM5vBtT5PnBIy9kReu7mSm1MrNlTDuMFRIQ-wl3zQB91wGiDNtNHb1U" width="185" height="134" alt="unnamed.jpg" style="border: none;"></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.2; text-align: center;"><a href="http://info.memphisinvest.com/ashley-tinker-one-to-one" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);"><b>Get to know Ashley Tinker</b></a></p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.2;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Georgia; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Ashley Tinker</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.2;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Georgia; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Portfolio Advisor</span><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Georgia; color: rgb(116, 27, 71); vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> </span></p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.2;"><span style="font-size: 9pt; font-family: Georgia; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Tel: </span><span style="font-size: 9pt; font-family: Georgia; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">901.505.0724</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.2;"><span style="font-size: 9pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><a href="mailto:ashley.tinker@memphisinvest.com" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);">ashley.tinker@memphisinvest.com</a></span><span style="font-size: 9pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 153); font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> </span></p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.2;"><span style="font-size: 9pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 153); font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><a href="http://www.memphisinvest.com/" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; font-weight: 400; white-space: normal;"><span style="font-size: 9pt; font-family: Arial; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">www.MemphisInvest.com</span></a><br></span></p><br><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 1.2; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 9pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 153); font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/OziIPRxCcWAzXoYYtLCcCBPvL7e7mtt3lUpN9_fGTWpbyfDaKIn6tayG9BZy1Ing1CcPSOQUKYmenX8okAzLVNoDOvLp1LjJgD2F3RxuZeGZUyr9PT8sCT2sw9RM-ENFXeVl_jxe" width="117" height="74" alt="unnamed.png" style="border: none;"></span></p><div style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-collapse: separate; font-family: georgia, serif;"><font size="1" style="font-family: verdana, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</font></div></div><div><font size="1" style="font-family: verdana, sans-serif;"><br></font></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br><